/bin/
*.test
*.prof
coverage.out

# Default `go build ./cmd/<name>` outputs land at the module root named after the
# command dir (e.g. `go build ./cmd/api` → ./api). Root-anchored so these only
# match the stray module-root binaries, never the cmd/<name>/ source packages.
/api
/dbprobe
/indexer
/market-stream
/routes
